              <span class="js-chip js-status"><i></i>مفتوح</span>
              <span class="js-chip js-assignee" data-who="ai"><span class="mini-av av-ai"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-bot"/></svg></span><span class="who-ai">ليلى · وكيل ذكي</span><span class="who-human" lang="en">Ahmed Ragab</span></span>
